  m_text: "Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only one known to support
    life. It has a diverse surface of oceans, mountains, forests, and deserts, and
    is 70% covered by water. Earth\u2019s atmosphere is rich in nitrogen and oxygen,
    which not only supports life but also protects the surface from harmful solar
    radiation. Its magnetic field and climate system make it uniquely habitable among
    all known planets."
